Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: Union Room chunk B, drop the Missing() traps for sub_02037F94/sub_02037FCC

Run 45 (union_guard off): the Union Room entry chain ran and the game crashed after it. ss3ds_union.c now defines these two comm
"linked" checks (answering 0) because the ported Union Room poll functions call them; a new patch because 0118 is already applied
in builder trees. If missing.c is ever regenerated, drop these names again (duplicate definitions at link).
---
 port/soulsilver-native-core/nitromain-perf/missing.c | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

--- a/port/soulsilver-native-core/nitromain-perf/missing.c
+++ b/port/soulsilver-native-core/nitromain-perf/missing.c
@@ -785,8 +785,6 @@
 __attribute__((noreturn)) void sub_02037824(void){Missing("sub_02037824");}
 __attribute__((noreturn)) void sub_02037880(void){Missing("sub_02037880");}
 __attribute__((noreturn)) void sub_02037C94(void){Missing("sub_02037C94");}
-__attribute__((noreturn)) void sub_02037F94(void){Missing("sub_02037F94");}
-__attribute__((noreturn)) void sub_02037FCC(void){Missing("sub_02037FCC");}
 __attribute__((noreturn)) void sub_02037FF0(void){Missing("sub_02037FF0");}
 __attribute__((noreturn)) void sub_020380B0(void){Missing("sub_020380B0");}
 __attribute__((noreturn)) void sub_020380CC(void){Missing("sub_020380CC");}
